{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1413476-fanmade-homebrew-flaws","id":1413476,"title":"Fanmade & Homebrew Flaws","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-13T19:00:01-07:00","id":1413476,"title":"Fanmade & Homebrew Flaws","content":"<b>Hungry for Family</b>: You are a Begotten that for some reason, can only feed off of those that register as kin.<br /> <br /> <b>The Curse of Unihar</b>: You are an uratha that carries the &quot;unihar-gene&quot;. Should you ever breed with another uratha, the result will always be an unihar.<br /> <br /> <b>Neuri Syndrome</b>: Uratha with Neuri Syndrome are defined by one thing, being stuck in Hishu form. This flaw can only be taken during the First Change.<br /> <br /> I've got more seven more ideas for flaws at the moment, but the ones above are the only ones that feel intact enough to share.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26055,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","user":"Krat05","date":". 09-13-2020, 10:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-14T02:23:40-07:00","id":1413515,"title":"","content":"Fealty to the Blood: You automatically obey every order given by your sire &amp; they don't have to work at it. Can only be taken by a kindred. You can theoretically disobey, but to do so you must contest your Willpower against that of your sire. The power of the Dominate Discipline can be added to either individual's roll if they have it.<br /> <br /> Versus Apex Lair Trait: For some reason or other, the Lair Trait that the local Apex imposes upon the local Primordial Dream seems to actively work against you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26055,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","user":"Krat05","date":". 10-09-2020, 06:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-05T14:18:17-07:00","id":1416900,"title":"","content":"Magic Addiction: You show signs of addiction in regards to the use of magic. You can also show withdrawal symptoms. Select a variety of magical energy, you become addicted whenever you interact with this particular magical energy.<br /> <br /> Arcane Allergies: You are allergic to magical energies. Select a variety of magical energy, you have allergic reactions whenever you interact with this particular magical energy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-05T18:51:45-07:00","id":1416927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1413476-fanmade-homebrew-flaws?p=1413515#post1413515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fealty to the Blood: You automatically obey every order given by your sire &amp; they don't have to work at it. Can only be taken by a kindred. You can theoretically disobey, but to do so you must contest your Willpower &amp; Resolve against that of your sire. The power of the Dominate Discipline can be added to either individual's roll if they have it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Willpower is normally equal to Resolve + Composure, so this is a rolloff of Resolve + Resolve + Composure + Dominate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}